{"game": "crab-champions", "language": "english", "appid": 774801, "month": "2025-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1762560000, "end_date": 1763251199, "month_true_total": 617, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-30 05:50:58 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "209333930", "author": {"steamid": "76561198804093149", "personaname": "Level99bowazon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198804093149/", "num_games_owned": 29, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 21777, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17855, "last_played": 1789447681, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "im a crab", "timestamp_created": 1763247799, "timestamp_updated": 1763247799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 20, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "209330769", "author": {"steamid": "76561198369180948", "personaname": "Mr. Coke", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198369180948/", "num_games_owned": 333, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6902, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6251, "last_played": 1765056487, "avatar": "77cd2cd8568ac52c1441ef36aa7d051138e7a7eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Most recent update changed a lot of things on how the game feels and plays. The graphics were redone and look great, maps were revamped but for the worse. Many of the maps are much smaller and more restrictive, allowing enemies to launch hundreds of projectiles at you while the map gives you 0 cover. The difficulty system was completely changed and doesnt feel as good as it was before. The loot also feels severely nerfed and is extremely difficult to get a good build going anymore.  Many of the good perks that were a common quality got moved to Epic which is much harder to roll for. The game felt more balanced before this most recent update and hotfix from Nov 2nd. I keep trying to play this and like it as much as I did before, but its more infuriating than fun at this point. I can't recommend this game at the moment in its current state. If some of the difficulty modifiers are reworked or add new ones to compensate for the unfun ones then I will adjust this review accordingly. I had most of my weapons all to Diamond rank, but now I cant even get a good start with the loot. I wish I could go back and play the pre-update version again as it was more fun.", "timestamp_created": 1763245229, "timestamp_updated": 1763245229, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540316462516784668", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1763481876, "developer_response": "Thanks for the review!\n\nI definitely agree with a lot of this and am working on improving the islands to have both more variety and space as well as reducing the feeling of needing good RNG to get a run going.\n\nI am curious, which parts of the difficulty system doesn't feel as good as before? I tried to keep it exactly the same as before but with just more player agency on the hardest difficulty instead of having modifiers baked into it that you couldn't turn off (Manual Collection). This way people aren't forced to play with modifiers they don't like on and have more of a choice on what they want to run 🦀\n\nEDIT: Responding to your comment\n\nReally great points, thank you! I'm working on a hotfix that should drop in the next week to address a bunch of common concerns including the enemy scaling feeling too steep!\n\nYeah the Elite Fire Crab jump attack can be tricky, he is allowed jump for that one attack as it meant to be a kind of sky slam attack- I'll make it a bit less likely for him to do it.", "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209315317", "author": {"steamid": "76561198188274711", "personaname": "MrWhite", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198188274711/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13697, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12646, "last_played": 1788410689, "avatar": "543bb32f9249e6738288c0d3ac6987ee25983c41"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1763234001, "timestamp_updated": 1763236377, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209311888", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160172727", "personaname": "yn willie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198160172727/", "num_games_owned": 264, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9770, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7886, "last_played": 1773586644, "avatar": "effd0894609e463a0973f223bb99bf47336ffa96"}, "language": "english", "review": "honestly im sad they removed most of the old islands. you can add new ones without getting rid of the old ones. i miss them. please bring them back.", "timestamp_created": 1763231709, "timestamp_updated": 1763231709, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 8, "c